Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.37,0:00:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,little friends! I'm Kiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.79,0:00:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Today the storybook opened
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,to a page... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This page is so weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a rabbit...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,wearing a vest?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.51,0:00:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The storybook showed a little white rabbit in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,red vest,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,holding a golden
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,pocket watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the picture came to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The rabbit jumped right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,out of the book!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm late! I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.79,0:00:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! A talking rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.11,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki chased the white rabbit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,running through the story house,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,past the little garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Late, late,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen of Hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,will be so angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.43,0:00:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The white rabbit ducked into a small
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki followed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,right after.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whooooa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.67,0:00:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki started falling down, down, down,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,like the longest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,slide ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As she fell,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.30,0:01:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,strange things floated by — books,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,clocks, teacups,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.83,0:01:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and playing cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.24,0:01:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki reached out to grab a flying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,book,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.31,0:01:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was just too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.55,0:01:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She fell for a long,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,until finally — plop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki landed softly on a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,bed of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.43,0:01:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Flowers everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Red flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,purple flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,blue flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,filling a long hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But where was the white
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,rabbit? He was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.19,0:01:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,White Rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of the hallway,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.72,0:01:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a tiny little door. Behind it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,something seemed to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:02:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever done something fun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,just because you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,were curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Kiki in the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,comments!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.55,0:02:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki finds a bottle that says 'Drink
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.29,0:02:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Me' and a cake that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,says 'Eat Me'!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.19,0:02:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,see you tomorrow~ 🌈
